  "text": "Home\nProducts\nSCIA - Structural Analysis and Design\nSCIA\nSCIA - Structural Analysis and Design\n\nSCIA delivers powerful structural analysis and design capabilities for engineers working on buildings, infrastructure, and complex structural systems. Explore the SCIA editions to find the solution that fits your engineering workflows and level of structural complexity.\n\nAdvanced structural analysis and code-based design.\nMulti-material engineering workflows.\nBIM-integrated structural modeling.\nSeamless collaboration with design and detailing tools.\nMORE INFORMATION\nCHOOSE YOUR SCIA EDITION\nFind the SCIA solution designed for you\n1 month\n12 months\n36 months\nSCIA Concept\n$298.00\n\nper user per month\n\nTotal $3,576.00 (excl. VAT) billed yearly\n\nADD TO CART\n\nWhat's included:\n\nStructural modeling and analysis\nCore concrete, steel, and timber design workflows\nStability and dynamic analysis tools\nBIM-ready model exchange\nAdvanced nonlinear analysis\nView Edition\nSCIA Professional\n$508.00\n\nper user per month\n\nTotal $6,096.00 (excl. VAT) billed yearly\n\nADD TO CART\n\nWhat's included:\n\nMulti-material design workflows\nParametric modeling tools\nAdvanced load generation\nSoil-structure interaction analysis\nExtended BIM integrations\nView Edition\nSCIA Ultimate\n$827.00\n\nper user per month\n\nTotal $9,924.00 (excl. VAT) billed yearly\n\nADD TO CART\n\nWhat's included:\n\nAdvanced nonlinear structural analysis\nSmart meshing and high-performance analysis\nConstruction stage simulation\nOptimization tools for structural design\nExtended engineering integrations\nView Edition\nLock in the price for 3 years\nBuy with flexibility and security\nChoose your payment method\nTechnical Support included\nNeed Help Choosing the Right SCIA Edition?\n\nTalk with an SCIA expert to find the best solution for your projects, workflows, and team.\n\nREQUEST DEMO\nTRUSTED BY GLOBAL AEC LEADERS\nSCIA\nCAPABILITIES\nSUCCESS STORIES\nFAQ\nREQUEST DEMO\nPRICING\nCAPABILITIES\nCompare Key Capabilities\nAccurate Structural Models\nAccurate Structural Models Create structural analysis models directly or convert BIM models into analysis-ready geometry. Engineers can define frames, surfaces, and structural systems that reflect real-world structural behavior.\nReliable Engineering Analysis\nAutomated Project Deliverables\nDesign Across Multiple Materials\nSUCCESS STORIES\nSCIA makes it possible\nSky Park Residence\n\nBratislava, Slovakia\n\nRead More\nPedestrian Bridge over the Railway Yard\n\nCzechia\n\nRead More\nThe Glass Dome at Albert Square\n\nBelgium\n\nRead More\nPalais Garnier\n\nFrance\n\nRead More\nRopeway Lattice Tower\n\nAustria\n\nRead More\nMulti-functional Sports Hall\n\nCzechia\n\nRead More\nFAQ\nFrequently Asked Questions\nWhat is the difference between SCIA Concept, Professional, and Ultimate?\nSCIA Concept focuses on core structural modeling and analysis for everyday engineering projects. SCIA Professional adds advanced engineering workflows, multi-material design, and expanded analysis capabilities. SCIA Ultimate provides the most comprehensive analysis tools for complex structures and advanced structural engineering challenges.\nDoes SCIA support BIM workflows?\nWhich industries use SCIA?\nCan I upgrade between SCIA editions later?\nTalk to an Expert\n\nGet personalized guidance from SCIA experts to find the right edition for your workflows, projects, and team. Book a free 1-hour consultation with no pressure, just clarity.\n\nREQUEST DEMO\nTry SCIA Free\n\nExplore SCIA for 30 days at no cost. For evaluation and non-commercial use. No cancellation required.\n\nGET FREE TRIAL",
