      "tag": "DETAILS",
      "text": "Accurate Structural ModelsAccurate Structural Models Create structural analysis models directly or convert BIM models into analysis-ready geometry. Engineers can define frames, surfaces, and structural systems that reflect real-world structural behavior."
    },
    {
      "tag": "DETAILS",
      "text": "Reliable Engineering AnalysisReliable Engineering Analysis Evaluate structural performance using linear, nonlinear, stability, and dynamic analysis tools to understand how structures respond to loads and design conditions."
    },
    {
      "tag": "DETAILS",
      "text": "Automated Project DeliverablesCode-Compliant Engineering Design Design reinforced concrete, steel, timber, and other structural materials using integrated design checks and calculation tools aligned with international engineering standards."
    },
    {
      "tag": "DETAILS",
      "text": "Design Across Multiple MaterialsDesign Across Multiple Materials Analyze and design concrete, steel, timber, aluminum, masonry, and composite structures within one engineering environment, allowing teams to evaluate multiple structural systems efficiently."
    },
